，原零預算三秒斷言保留。修後角色子集16案例61斷言全綠，r2-role-zero-budget-green.json，正式預設仍3秒。這只修零預算入口，不冒稱已收緊所有正預算 Git 查詢；既有正預算兩趟讀取限制仍沿原角色計劃的事件／日期回頭條件。\n     1\tlumos 自動附加(設計審):計劃筆記提到的程式檔牽連的固定席節點 + 計劃直接連結的節點(從工作樹讀,只供參考)\n     2\t落點現況(計劃的 lands_in;判斷該寫進既有那篇,還是另開一篇):\n     3\t  - Systems/retrieval-ranking:已存在;掛 0 份計劃、13 行 KEY、0 條合約、管 2 支檔、沒寫負責範圍\n     4\t  - Systems/測試假綠形態:已存在;掛 0 份計劃、12 行 KEY、1 條合約、管 1 支檔、沒寫負責範圍\n     5\t  - Systems/pitfalls-code-loop:已存在;掛 0 份計劃、20 行 KEY、0 條合約、管 1 支檔、沒寫負責範圍\n\nhook: PostToolUse\nhook: PostToolUse Completed\ncodex\n三份指定審材已完整讀完。接下來我會按鏡頭逐項驗證：分類入口是否真的以「凍結模式＋對應 Git 物件首行」決定，並分別追普通附件、程式副檔名、無副檔名、可執行、刪除、staged，以及角色鏡頭與零預算路徑。\nhook: PreToolUse\nhook: PreToolUse Completed\nexec\n/bin/zsh -lc 'rg -n \"def (_impact_diff_seed_ok|_impact_diff_modes|_review_role_changed_files|_review_roles|_codeloop_raw_changes|_codeloop_raw_modes)|_impact_diff_seed_ok|_impact_diff_modes|_review_role_changed_files|_review_roles|_codeloop_raw_changes|_codeloop_raw_modes\" scripts/lumos scripts/test_lumos.py && rg -n \"t_impact_diff_review_artifacts|t_impact_diff_bookkeeping_code_controls|review_role|zero_budget|raw_modes|raw_changes|bookkeeping_code\" scripts/test_lumos.py' in /private/tmp/lumos-review-artifact-impact-inputs\nhook: PostToolUse\n succeeded in 60ms:\nscripts/lumos:24312:def _review_roles_config(data, unreadable=False):\nscripts/lumos:24366:def _review_role_changed_files(root, base, head):\nscripts/lumos:24369:    (_vendored_skip)、文件與帳檔(_impact_diff_seed_ok)。git 跑不起來回 None。\"\"\"\nscripts/lumos:24383:    modes = _impact_diff_modes(root, [path for path, _ref in out], base, head)\nscripts/lumos:24388:            and _impact_diff_seed_ok(path, *modes.get(path, (None, None))) and path not in skip]\nscripts/lumos:24391:def _review_roles(root, base, head, budget=_ROLE_BUDGET):\nscripts/lumos:24401:    rules, warnings = _review_roles_config(cfg, unreadable=bool(_cfg_there and _cfg_there.returncode == 0))\nscripts/lumos:24402:    files = _review_role_changed_files(root, base, head)\nscr